<div class="am-section red-section center">
<div class="am-row block-affordability">
<div class="am-column-1-4">
<p class="number-box-aff">6</p>
<p class="title-box-aff">locations</p>
</div>
<div class="am-column-1-4">
<p class="number-box-aff">1%</p>
<p class="title-box-aff">for affordability nationwide</p>
</div>
<div class="am-column-1-4">
<p class="number-box-aff">21:1</p>
<p class="title-box-aff">student-to-faculty ratio</p>
</div>
<div class="am-column-1-4">
<p class="number-box-aff">170+</p>
<p class="title-box-aff">academic pathways</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="am-section">
<div class="am-row" style="padding-bottom: 0px;">
<div class="am-column-1-1 center">
<h2>Where are you headed?</h2>
<p>CF can help you reach your goals.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="am-row" style="padding-top: 0px;">
<div class="am-column-1-2 center"><img decoding="async" class="box-shadow" src="https://www.cf.edu/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/CF-graduate.jpg" alt="Happy woman smiling with her diploma after graduation" /><br />
<img decoding="async" class="bound-image" style="margin-top: 50px;" src="https://www.cf.edu/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Bachelors-Bound.svg" alt="Bachelor's bound logo" />Earn your bachelor’s degree at CF or start here and then transfer to one of Florida’s top universities!</p>
<p><a class="am-button-1" href="/academics/degrees-and-certificates/bachelor-bound/">Explore Options</a></p>
</div>
<div class="am-column-1-2 center"><img decoding="async" class="box-shadow red-box-shadow" src="https://www.cf.edu/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/CF-radiography.jpg" alt="Group of students training to work in a radiography room" /><br />
<img decoding="async" class="bound-image" style="margin-top: 50px;" src="https://www.cf.edu/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Workforce-Bound.svg" alt="Workforce bound logo" />Our short-term workforce programs are designed to get you into your career as quickly as possible.</p>
<p><a class="am-button-3" href="/academics/degrees-and-certificates/workforce/">View Workforce Programs</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="am-section dark-section" style="background-image: url('https://www.cf.edu/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/mochaGrunge_@2X-blue-1.png'); background-repeat: repeat; background-size: initial;">
<div class="am-row">
<div class="am-column-3-5">
<p class="pre-h">Degrees &amp; programs</p>
<h2>Find your future</h2>
<p>See our entire catalog of degrees, programs, and certifications offered at our campuses. Search for your passion and discover how we can help you make it possible.</p>
<div class="block-contact form-home-filter">
<div class="wrapper-input pf-search-wrap">
<div class="wrapp-input-control"><input id="fname" class="fname search-input-large" autocomplete="off" name="fname" type="text" value="" placeholder="Search available degrees..." aria-label="Search" /></div>
<div class="search-opts"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="am-column-2-5">
<h3>Areas of Study</h3>
<ul class="box-bullets">
<li><a class="am-button-4" href="https://www.cf.edu/academics/areas-of-study/arts-and-sciences/">Arts and Sciences</a></li>
<li><a class="am-button-4" href="https://www.cf.edu/academics/areas-of-study/business-and-technology/">Business and Technology</a></li>
<li><a class="am-button-4" href="https://www.cf.edu/academics/areas-of-study/criminal-justice-and-public-service/">Criminal Justice and Public Service</a></li>
<li><a class="am-button-4" href="https://www.cf.edu/academics/areas-of-study/digital-media-technology/">Digital Media Technology</a></li>
<li><a class="am-button-4" href="https://www.cf.edu/academics/areas-of-study/health-sciences/">Health Sciences</a></li>
<li><a class="am-button-4" href="https://www.cf.edu/academics/areas-of-study/teacher-education/">Teacher Education</a></li>
<li><a class="am-button-4" href="https://www.cf.edu/academics/areas-of-study/welding-technology/">Welding Technology</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="am-section center">
<div class="am-row" style="margin-bottom: -100px;">
<div class="am-column-1-1">
<h2>Upcoming events</h2>
</div>
</div>
<div class="am-row block-events-tribe">
<div class="am-column-1-1">
<div  class="tribe-compatibility-container tribe-theme-twentynineteen" >
	<div
		 class="tribe-common tribe-events tribe-events-view tribe-events-view--widget-events-list tribe-events-widget" 		data-js="tribe-events-view"
		data-view-rest-url="https://www.cf.edu/wp-json/tribe/views/v2/html"
		data-view-manage-url="1"
							data-view-breakpoint-pointer="4e706d4d-58aa-435d-8b46-aab1c0bba268"
			>
