<h3 class="vintage-location" name_block="vintage-location"><span class="icon_pin"></span>Vintage Farm Campus</h3>
<div class="block-description-question" url_image_location="https://www.cf.edu/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/vintage.jpg">
<p><span class="icon_compass"></span>4020 S.E. Third Ave., Ocala, FL 34470-5001</p>
